{"nodes": [{"id": "recovered_prediction_s87_item1_kinetic_cap_kinetic_cap", "label": "The kinetic cap on S''", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "For the direct frozen-core field S''(u) = r^2 rho_r(r), and H^1 supplies a sup-bound: sup P^2 <= ||P'||_2 = sqrt(2 T_rad). That yields three nested caps M_u1 (total core kinetic energy), M_u2 (per-orbital gradient norms) and M_u3 (the orbit-local sup, the ceiling of the sup-language), all produced by the field and none entered.", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S87-ITEM1-KINETIC-CAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_s87_item1_kinetic_cap_sup_p2_bound", "label": "sup P^2 <= ||P'||_2 from P(0)=0 and normalisation", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Splitting int 2 P P' at r from both sides and applying Cauchy-Schwarz on the two halves gives the bound with the centrifugal term dropped, so T_rad <= T.", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S87-ITEM1-KINETIC-CAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_s87_item1_kinetic_cap_ramp_extremal", "label": "The single-ramp bang-bang extremal under the cap", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "With sigma = S'' in [0,M] and two linear constraints (mass V+ and chord), the extreme sigma are bang-bang; the candidate is a single ramp of width V+/M pinned by the chord, and as M -> inf the ramp tends to the tent. The extremal claim is CHECKED, not proved: if a random bang-bang profile beats the ramp, the clauses score on the max and the ramp claim is registered as a fault.", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S87-ITEM1-KINETIC-CAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_s87_item1_kinetic_cap_s86_correction", "label": "Correction to s86 \u00a73: a kink in S is a delta in S''", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "A kink in S is a delta-shell in rho, not a step in rho_r; a step in rho_r is a kink in S', which is a jump in S'' and is admissible to a sup-bound. The excluding language is therefore a bound on sup S''.", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S87-ITEM1-KINETIC-CAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_s87_item1_kinetic_cap_localisation_loss", "label": "The loss is in the localisation, not the inequality", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "median(M_u2/M_u3) > 10 against median(M_u1/M_u2) < 3: a global sup over r <= r_out against an orbit-local one is where the bound is thrown away, and tau ~ 1e-3 makes the ramp indistinguishable from the tent, so the bound from T certifies almost nothing.", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S87-ITEM1-KINETIC-CAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_s87_item1_kinetic_cap_f86_1_scoring", "label": "F86.1 scoring discipline: statistic and population per clause", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Every clause names its population ([A,74], [A,K>=1,50]) and its statistic, with timing flags in source \u2014 the standing repair for the F83.1 population species at its fifteenth appearance.", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S87-ITEM1-KINETIC-CAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "recovered_prediction_s87_item1_kinetic_cap_kinetic_cap", "target": "recovered_prediction_s86_item1_gauss_cut_sobolev_next_step", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S87-ITEM1-KINETIC-CAP.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_prediction_s87_item1_kinetic_cap_s86_correction", "target": "recovered_prediction_s86_item1_gauss_cut_sobolev_next_step", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S87-ITEM1-KINETIC-CAP.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_prediction_s87_item1_kinetic_cap_sup_p2_bound", "target": "recovered_prediction_s87_item1_kinetic_cap_kinetic_cap", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S87-ITEM1-KINETIC-CAP.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_prediction_s87_item1_kinetic_cap_ramp_extremal", "target": "recovered_prediction_s85_item1_the_bound_tent_extremal", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S87-ITEM1-KINETIC-CAP.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_prediction_s87_item1_kinetic_cap_localisation_loss", "target": "recovered_prediction_s87_item1_kinetic_cap_kinetic_cap", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S87-ITEM1-KINETIC-CAP.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_prediction_s87_item1_kinetic_cap_kinetic_cap", "target": "recovered_prediction_s85_item1_the_bound_variable_q_bound", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S87-ITEM1-KINETIC-CAP.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_prediction_s87_item1_kinetic_cap_f86_1_scoring", "target": "recovered_prediction_s83_item1b_frontier_f83_1", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S87-ITEM1-KINETIC-CAP.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_prediction_s87_item1_kinetic_cap_f86_1_scoring", "target": "recovered_prediction_s85_item1_the_bound_population_declaration", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S87-ITEM1-KINETIC-CAP.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_prediction_s87_item1_kinetic_cap_ramp_extremal", "target": "recovered_prediction_s87_item1_kinetic_cap_kinetic_cap", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S87-ITEM1-KINETIC-CAP.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_prediction_s87_item1_kinetic_cap_localisation_loss", "target": "recovered_prediction_s84_item1_semiclassical_charge_blindness", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S87-ITEM1-KINETIC-CAP.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": [{"id": "clause_1_derivation_chain_s83_to_s87", "label": "Clause 1 derivation chain: Madelung to g-ladder to anchor to K<1 to the kinetic cap", "nodes": ["recovered_prediction_s83_item1_gladder_g_within", "recovered_prediction_s83_item1b_frontier_frontier_width", "recovered_prediction_s84_item1_semiclassical_anchor_theorem", "recovered_prediction_s85_item1_the_bound_variable_q_bound", "recovered_prediction_s86_item1_gauss_cut_tent_admissible", "recovered_prediction_s87_item1_kinetic_cap_kinetic_cap"], "relation": "form", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S87-ITEM1-KINETIC-CAP.md"}]}